---
layout: default
title: Why freediving
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16 grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_390px] lg:gap-14">
    <h1 class="mb-0 mt-0 text-balance text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">Freediving gives your life back.</h1>
    <div class="w-full max-w-[390px]">
      <blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/p/DbiFJKNTMVc/" data-instgrm-version="14"></blockquote>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">The whole underwater world is in the first ten metres.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Below that there is nothing left to look at, so you look inward. We go out to sea and drift. Very deep states of consciousness are reachable down there.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Start down, and everything arrives at once.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">The moment you hold your breath and descend, every thought you own turns up. You start filtering. The noise drops.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="mb-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Then room opens up inside you. For you.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-xl">Your character fights it first. On the way down you hear his thoughts &mdash; get out, we are drowning. Relax him and he settles. He is still settled when you surface, and he stays that way at the desk, in the hard conversation, at&nbsp;3am.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-20 grid gap-12 border-t border-current/10 pt-14 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-14">
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Deeper means calmer.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Equalize early, turn when planned and surface with enough reserve for a calm recovery breath.</p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Molchanovs Wave 1 and Wave 2 certification is available. In water, always train with an active, qualified buddy and stay within conservative limits.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Water teaches calm for life.</h2>
      <p class="mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Children float, swim, glide and dive with a qualified instructor beside them, one skill at a time. <a href="/junior/" class="font-bold decoration-sky-200 decoration-8">More for young divers</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <a href="https://t.me/firedev" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn mt-16">Get in touch</a>
</div>

